{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/o7gcba","slideIndex":0,"text":"Team Tenet. VajraSetu is a prototype system for recording the colour state of a passive H2S sensing band. This is not a real-time gas detector and does not establish air safety or legal compliance. Current status source [3]: README.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/SCANNER_AND_CALIBRATION.md in local repository snapshot 57d48d1238d04b483a492bf38bbc212b745c98f2, inspected 26 October 2026. https://github.com/aaryanadiger/VajraSetu/tree/57d48d1238d04b483a492bf38bbc212b745c98f2\nVisual: custom AI-generated concept image using OpenAI ImageGen, 26 October 2026. The scene and product are illustrative, not a field trial photograph.\nInspiration: https://www.canva.com/design/DAHVkQadZBA/8sKx2MfSjISZCmg6W30OqA/edit. Read only. Original design was not modified."}
