{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/nuqoq8","slideIndex":2,"text":"[3] https://github.com/aaryanadiger/VajraSetu/tree/57d48d1238d04b483a492bf38bbc212b745c98f2. Sources: docs/SCANNER_AND_CALIBRATION.md (expected CuSO4 sensing patch, FeSO4 validity dot, neutral reference), docs/ARCHITECTURE.md (three final capture frames, local SQLite data and language behaviour), README.md (implemented status). The physical sensor and expiry chemistry require batch-specific calibration and independent validation. Current implementation uses known-layout sampling and deterministic rules, not a trained ML model. Colour categories are provisional. Core copy is bundled in English, Bhojpuri, Hindi, Marathi and Kannada. Non-core strings in supported languages may use Sarvam fallback and cache.\nVisual: custom AI-generated product concept illustration, OpenAI ImageGen, 26 October 2026. It is not a photo or production specification."}
